# Cloudflare Pages response headers. Copied to the build root by adapter-static.
# CSP is intentionally NOT set here — it lives in app.html's <meta> tag, which carries the
# %RECKONS_EXTRA_CONNECT_SRC% build placeholder; duplicating it as a header risks divergence.
# These are the safe, non-CSP hardening headers that do not affect app behaviour.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
